{"body_text": "Warning—Use only as directed. Intentional misuse by deliberately concentrating and inhaling the contents can be harmful or fatal.", "chapter": "I", "content_sha256": "97657108adf6415356ee1604510a968faa83b97d548713ff8821472cb7f40c7c", "ecfr_permalink": "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-21/chapter-I/subchapter-G/part-740/section-740.11", "effective_date": "2026-09-03", "fr_citation": "[40 FR 8917, Mar. 3, 1975, as amended at 42 FR 22033, Apr. 29, 1977; 54 FR 39640, Sept. 27, 1989; 61 FR 20101, May 3, 1996]", "govinfo_pdf_url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CFR-2026-title21-vol7/pdf/CFR-2026-title21-vol7-part740.pdf", "id": "01a15ddc-c1be-762c-bd83-d921e039c610", "incorporated_standard_id": null, "is_reserved": false, "last_amended_date": null, "ordinal": 6, "paragraph_path": "(b)(1)", "parent_headings": ["Cosmetics", "Part 740 - Cosmetic Product Warning Statements", "Subpart B - Warning Statements"], "part_number": "740", "path_ordinal": 1, "removed_on": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-21T14:42:55+05:30", "section_heading": "Cosmetics in self-pressurized containers.", "section_number": "740.11", "snapshot_date": "2026-09-03", "source_endpoint": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-09-03/title-21.xml?chapter=I&part=740", "source_payload_sha256": "1b33d44258aaa462d5c328358b610ee8b37361b608827d07074ae0f5bd6838fd", "subchapter_code": "G", "subpart_id": "01a07ab4-7c13-7d79-9261-b613f22b874c", "title": "21"},
{"body_text": "Caution—For external use only. Spray at least 8 inches from skin. Do not apply to broken, irritated, or itching skin. Persistent, unusual odor or discharge may indicate conditions for which a physician should be consulted. Discontinue use immediately if rash, irritation, or discomfort develops.", "chapter": "I", "content_sha256": "9dd949f7f8eb19fac0072bef2609163b448a343c713fda8201733c1a30be9833", "ecfr_permalink": "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-21/chapter-I/subchapter-G/part-740/section-740.12", "effective_date": "2026-09-03", "fr_citation": "[40 FR 8929, Mar. 3, 1975]", "govinfo_pdf_url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CFR-2026-title21-vol7/pdf/CFR-2026-title21-vol7-part740.pdf", "id": "01a15ddc-c1ca-715d-8cb4-13fe2a4f9efb", "incorporated_standard_id": null, "is_reserved": false, "last_amended_date": null, "ordinal": 2, "paragraph_path": "(b)", "parent_headings": ["Cosmetics", "Part 740 - Cosmetic Product Warning Statements", "Subpart B - Warning Statements"], "part_number": "740", "path_ordinal": 1, "removed_on": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-21T14:42:55+05:30", "section_heading": "Feminine deodorant sprays.", "section_number": "740.12", "snapshot_date": "2026-09-03", "source_endpoint": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-09-03/title-21.xml?chapter=I&part=740", "source_payload_sha256": "1b33d44258aaa462d5c328358b610ee8b37361b608827d07074ae0f5bd6838fd", "subchapter_code": "G", "subpart_id": "01a07ab4-7c13-7d79-9261-b613f22b874c", "title": "21"},
{"body_text": "The sentence “Spray at least 8 inches from skin” need not be included in the cautionary statement for products whose expelled contents do not contain a liquified gas propellant such as a halocarbon or hydrocarbon propellant.", "chapter": "I", "content_sha256": "fcc99bba442ba7d0e221abb8e23751bd41a36e2700a13b294233df317b4db7c9", "ecfr_permalink": "https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-21/chapter-I/subchapter-G/part-740/section-740.12", "effective_date": "2026-09-03", "fr_citation": "[40 FR 8929, Mar. 3, 1975]", "govinfo_pdf_url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/CFR-2026-title21-vol7/pdf/CFR-2026-title21-vol7-part740.pdf", "id": "01a15ddc-c1ca-7689-b402-a34a2f85c5d6", "incorporated_standard_id": null, "is_reserved": false, "last_amended_date": null, "ordinal": 3, "paragraph_path": "(b)", "parent_headings": ["Cosmetics", "Part 740 - Cosmetic Product Warning Statements", "Subpart B - Warning Statements"], "part_number": "740", "path_ordinal": 2, "removed_on": null, "retrieved_at": "2026-10-21T14:42:55+05:30", "section_heading": "Feminine deodorant sprays.", "section_number": "740.12", "snapshot_date": "2026-09-03", "source_endpoint": "https://www.ecfr.gov/api/versioner/v1/full/2026-09-03/title-21.xml?chapter=I&part=740", "source_payload_sha256": "1b33d44258aaa462d5c328358b610ee8b37361b608827d07074ae0f5bd6838fd", "subchapter_code": "G", "subpart_id": "01a07ab4-7c13-7d79-9261-b613f22b874c", "title": "21"},
